---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout activeNav="colophon" title="Colophon — MODUSENSUS">
  <header class="container page-header">
    <div class="mono-label">04 — ABOUT</div>
    <h1 class="page-header-title">COLOPHON</h1>
    <p class="page-header-subtitle">ABOUT MODUSENSUS</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container board">
    <hr class="board-rule" />
    <div class="list-narrow">

      <div class="mono-label group-label">01 — STUDIO</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <p>MODUSENSUS 是一个长期运营的独立数字工作室，关注城市、数据与创造力的交汇处。</p>
        <p><strong>Modus</strong>：方式、方法、模式。<br /><strong>Sensus</strong>：感知、理解、意义。</p>
        <p>以慢思考对抗信息过载，以清晰结构承载复杂议题。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">02 — BACKGROUND</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <p>城市规划 · 公共管理背景，着迷于空间设计、数据分析与 AI 的交叉地带。</p>
        <p>正在用 Python 做空间数据分析，搭建个人知识系统与自动化工作流；在这里写下关于城市、技术与创造性思考的文字。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">03 — TECH STACK</div>
      <div class="about-block stack-block">
        <div class="stack-row">
          <span class="mono-meta">DATA &amp; BACKEND</span>
          <div class="pills-row">
            <span class="pill">Python</span><span class="pill">FastAPI</span><span class="pill">pandas</span><span class="pill">NumPy</span><span class="pill">Matplotlib</span><span class="pill">SQLite</span><span class="pill">Anaconda</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-row">
          <span class="mono-meta">FRONTEND &amp; AGENT</span>
          <div class="pills-row">
            <span class="pill">HTML5</span><span class="pill">CSS3</span><span class="pill">JavaScript</span><span class="pill">Node.js</span><span class="pill">NestJS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-row">
          <span class="mono-meta">TOOLS</span>
          <div class="pills-row">
            <span class="pill">Figma</span><span class="pill">Docker</span><span class="pill">GIS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">04 — EXPLORING</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <ul class="explore-list">
          <li><strong>城市设计与空间公平</strong> — 基于 GIS 可达性分析的毕业设计</li>
          <li><strong>Python 空间数据分析</strong> — 在城市场景中应用数据分析与可视化</li>
          <li><strong>AI 辅助工作流</strong> — 用工具自动化研究与创作流程</li>
          <li><strong>数字出版</strong> — 通过博客与笔记构建个人知识系统</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="explore-quote">"Exploring how cities, data, and design can come together."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">05 — TYPOGRAPHY</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="type-row"><span class="mono-meta">DISPLAY</span><span class="type-sample">Archivo — 900</span></div>
        <div class="type-row"><span class="mono-meta">MONO</span><span class="type-sample mono">Space Mono — 700</span></div>
        <div class="type-row"><span class="mono-meta">BODY</span><span class="type-sample cn">Noto Sans SC — 400/900</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">06 — DESIGN ARCHIVE</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <a class="lab-row" href="/" >
          <span class="lab-year">V4</span>
          <span>
            <span class="lab-name">Doodle Editorial</span><br />
            <span class="lab-desc">当前版本 · 深色涂鸦 Hero × 浅色编辑排版，杂志式正文与阅读侧栏。</span>
          </span>
          <span class="badge">NOW</span>
        </a>
        <a class="lab-row" href="/works/v3-blog/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="lab-year">V3</span>
          <span>
            <span class="lab-name">Three-Column Feed</span><br />
            <span class="lab-desc">LinkedIn 式三栏布局 · 导航栏 + 内容流 + 视觉侧栏（模板演示）。</span>
          </span>
          <span class="badge">2026</span>
        </a>
        <a class="lab-row" href="/works/v2-blog/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="lab-year">V2</span>
          <span>
            <span class="lab-name">Digital Magazine</span><br />
            <span class="lab-desc">数字杂志版 · 衬线编辑风与自动滚动卡片（模板演示）。</span>
          </span>
          <span class="badge">2026</span>
        </a>
        <a class="lab-row" href="/works/original-site/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="lab-year">V1</span>
          <span>
            <span class="lab-name">Original Blog</span><br />
            <span class="lab-desc">站点最初版本 · 杂志感静态风格（模板演示）。</span>
          </span>
          <span class="badge">2025</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">07 — NEWSLETTER</div>
      <div class="newsletter-block">
        <p class="nl-lead">新文章摘要与精选内容，直接送进邮箱。低频率、尊重注意力，随时可退。</p>
        <a class="nl-cta" href="https://buttondown.com/modusensus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span>订阅专栏信</span>
          <span class="nl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">08 — CONTACT</div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="contact-row">
          <a href="https://github.com/modusensus" class="footer-icon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
            <span>GITHUB</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:hello@modusensus.com" class="footer-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><rect x="1.5" y="2.5" width="13" height="11" rx="1"/><path d="M2 4l6 5 6-5"/></svg>
            <span>EMAIL</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/rss.xml" class="footer-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M2 13.5a1.5 1.5 0 110 3 1.5 1.5 0 010-3z"/><path d="M2 8a6 6 0 016 6H6a4 4 0 00-4-4V8z"/><path d="M2 2a12 12 0 0112 12h-2a10 10 0 00-10-10V2z"/></svg>
            <span>RSS</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/modusensus/" class="footer-icon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.36-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.45v6.29zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.72v20.55C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.72C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg>
            <span>LINKEDIN</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://modusensus.substack.com/" class="footer-icon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3 4h18v2.2H3zM3 8.6h18v2.2H3zM3 13.2h18V21l-9-4.4L3 21z"/></svg>
            <span>SUBSTACK</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">09 — RESEARCH</div>
      <div class="about-block pills-row">
        <span class="pill">空间公平与城市可达性</span>
        <span class="pill">数字治理与 AI 政策</span>
        <span class="pill">人机协作与自动化工作流</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-label group-label">10 — PRIVACY &amp; SECURITY</div>
      <div class="about-block legal-block">
        <div class="legal-row" id="privacy">
          <span class="mono-meta">PRIVACY · 隐私声明</span>
          <ul class="legal-list">
            <li>本站为纯静态站点，托管于 Vercel。访问统计使用 Vercel Analytics，仅记录匿名流量，不使用 Cookie、不识别个人身份。</li>
            <li>浏览器本地存储（localStorage）仅用于保存主题偏好与文章点赞记录，数据不出本机；页脚统计使用会话级随机会话标识（sessionStorage）与 24 小时去重 Cookie（仅记录访问日期用于去重，不含身份信息），在线人数与浏览计数均为匿名聚合数据。</li>
            <li>留言板由 Waline 提供支持，留言内容存储于评论服务端数据库；昵称与邮箱为必填项，网址选填，邮箱仅用于接收回复通知。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="legal-row" id="security">
          <span class="mono-meta">SECURITY · 安全协议</span>
          <ul class="legal-list">
            <li>全站通过 HTTPS 加密传输，由 Vercel 托管。</li>
            <li>评论服务端仅保存留言内容与填写的昵称/邮箱/网址，无账号密码凭证。</li>
            <li>页脚总浏览与在线人数统计存于 Upstash KV（Redis），仅记录匿名会话标识与累计计数，不存 IP 或设备指纹；在线心跳 65 秒内自动过期，总浏览数可随时清零。</li>
            <li>评论客户端随站点同源打包，不加载第三方 CDN 脚本。</li>
            <li>如发现安全问题，欢迎通过上方 Email 联系。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-block {
  padding: 20px 0 8px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  font-family: var(--font-cn);
  font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--ink-soft);
}
.about-block p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.about-block strong { color: var(--ink); }
.about-block .lab-row:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
.about-block .lab-row { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft); }
.about-block .lab-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

.type-row {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
  padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
}
.type-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
.type-sample { font-family: var(--font-grot); font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; }
.type-sample.mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }
.type-sample.cn { font-family: var(--font-cn); font-weight: 400; font-size: 17px; }

.contact-row { display: flex; gap: 28px; padding: 4px 0; }
.pills-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-bottom: 20px; }

.stack-row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr; gap: 14px;
  align-items: start;
  padding: 10px 0;
}
.stack-row + .stack-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft); }
.stack-row .pills-row { padding-bottom: 6px; }

.explore-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.explore-list li {
  padding-left: 20px; position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.explore-list li::before {
  content: '■';
  position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.5em;
  font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted);
}
.explore-list strong { color: var(--ink); }
.explore-quote {
  font-family: var(--font-grot);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.legal-row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr; gap: 14px;
  align-items: start;
  padding: 10px 0;
}
.legal-row + .legal-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft); }
.legal-row .mono-meta { padding-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap; }
.legal-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0; margin: 0;
}
.legal-list li {
  padding-left: 20px; position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.legal-list li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.legal-list li::before {
  content: '■';
  position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.5em;
  font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted);
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .stack-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .legal-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
}

/* ── NEWSLETTER 订阅块：报纸风，油墨双线框 + mono 标签 + 大号 CTA ── */
.newsletter-block {
  padding: 22px 24px;
  margin: 6px 0 8px;
  background: var(--paper-raise);
  border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  box-shadow: 3px 5px 0 rgba(34, 30, 24, 0.08);
}
.nl-lead {
  font-family: var(--font-cn);
  font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}
.nl-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  text-decoration: none;
  background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
  padding: 11px 20px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: background 0.2s var(--ease-out), gap 0.2s var(--ease-out);
}
.nl-cta:hover {
  background: var(--c-pink);
  gap: 16px;
}
.nl-arrow { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1; }
</style>
